"""porch-e2e: throwaway DigitalOcean droplet for porch's fresh-install path.

Usage: porch-e2e up [--region R] [--size S] [--branch B] [--redeploy]
       porch-e2e up --installer [--image debian-12-x64] [--production] [--domain D --dns-provider P]
       porch-e2e status | ssh [cmd...] | logs [-n N] | down [--yes]
Implementation: lib/porch_e2e.py
"""

